1
00:01:37,872 --> 00:01:46,419
And now, presenting Mokku, the rarest
wooden puppet in the world, who moves
freely without strings and even sings!

2
00:01:51,289 --> 00:01:55,060
First, Mokku will sing and walk!

3
00:01:57,520 --> 00:02:00,700
Come on, Mokku, sing. Sing!

4
00:02:01,040 --> 00:02:04,120
B-But I don't know any songs!

5
00:02:05,087 --> 00:02:07,298
Idiot, just make something up!

6
00:02:07,540 --> 00:02:09,466
But I...

7
00:02:09,693 --> 00:02:13,660
You bastard, you know what'll
happen if you don't sing!

8
00:02:20,225 --> 00:02:22,874
Come on! That's it, go!

9
00:02:29,460 --> 00:02:35,240
♪ Boku wa kashi no ki, ki no ningyo. ♪
I am an oak tree, a wooden puppet.

10
00:02:36,680 --> 00:02:42,151
♪ Atama no naka made kashi no ki darake ♪
Even the inside of my head is pure oak.

11
00:02:43,417 --> 00:02:49,121
♪ Yarukoto kodomo to kawaranai ♪
Everything I do is just like a child.

12
00:02:50,623 --> 00:02:53,495
♪ Dakedo dakedo ♪
But still, but still,

13
00:02:53,519 --> 00:02:59,623
♪ sabishi toki ni wa namida ga deru yo ♪
when I'm lonely, the tears start to flow.

14
00:03:01,543 --> 00:03:04,415
♪ Boku wa kanashi ♪
I'm just a sad

15
00:03:04,945 --> 00:03:06,660
♪ ki no ningyo ♪
wooden puppet

16
00:03:08,775 --> 00:03:11,342
♪ ki no ningyo ♪
wooden puppet

17
00:03:17,086 --> 00:03:25,148
Now, ladies and gentlemen,
our next act is a delightful puppet
performance: "The Polka Dance"!

18
00:03:27,420 --> 00:03:28,713
Hey, dance!

19
00:03:28,799 --> 00:03:33,301
But... I-I can't dance...

20
00:03:34,122 --> 00:03:36,440
Idiot! Just dance however you want!

21
00:03:36,613 --> 00:03:38,173
But I...

22
00:03:42,160 --> 00:03:43,160
There!

23
00:04:01,444 --> 00:04:03,348
Come on, just like that!

24
00:05:02,446 --> 00:05:04,809
Today was three times the usual crowd.

25
00:05:05,169 --> 00:05:07,846
From now on, I will make a bundle!

26
00:05:18,066 --> 00:05:19,066
Mokku...

27
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:23,620
I feel bad for him, but he's about to
go through something way worse.

28
00:05:23,920 --> 00:05:29,840
That's right. We puppets are
just playthings for humans.

29
00:05:30,710 --> 00:05:34,800
They work you to the bone, and in
the end, they throw you into the fire.

30
00:05:35,050 --> 00:05:37,597
No matter how terribly we're
treated, it can't be helped.

31
00:05:37,910 --> 00:05:41,380
We've been puppets from
the day we were made.

32
00:05:47,700 --> 00:05:49,214
Grandpa...

33
00:05:52,193 --> 00:05:53,833
Mokku...

34
00:06:25,670 --> 00:06:32,175
Mokku, where did you go?
I'm all alone again...

35
00:06:34,015 --> 00:06:37,332
Please come home, my Mokku.

36
00:06:42,150 --> 00:06:44,189
Grandpa, I'm sorry.

37
00:06:45,540 --> 00:06:49,428
Mokku, have you come to your senses yet?

38
00:06:49,453 --> 00:06:51,639
Didn't I tell you back at the junk shop?

39
00:06:51,664 --> 00:06:54,000
Grandpa is the one you should
feel sorry for, not yourself.

40
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:58,273
Grandpa's so worried
about you he can't sleep.

41
00:06:58,461 --> 00:07:01,777
He even sold his coat and caught a cold.

42
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:04,539
And forgetting his kindness
makes you an awful guy, Mokku.

43
00:07:06,200 --> 00:07:08,123
Oh? Did that make you mad, Mokku?

44
00:07:09,190 --> 00:07:11,040
I'm going to work for Grandpa.

45
00:07:11,580 --> 00:07:14,390
Well, I'll be. Where on earth?

46
00:07:14,570 --> 00:07:17,603
I'll work here and buy Grandpa
an overcoat before I go home.

47
00:07:19,867 --> 00:07:21,637
You're so naive.

48
00:07:23,490 --> 00:07:25,456
The world doesn't work that easily.

49
00:07:25,722 --> 00:07:26,878
You'd better give up.

50
00:07:28,302 --> 00:07:30,144
I've had enough of your meddling.

51
00:07:30,630 --> 00:07:32,433
Take my advice, Mokku.

52
00:07:32,605 --> 00:07:35,101
If you trust humans too much,
you'll make a fool of yourself.

53
00:07:35,257 --> 00:07:36,325
Hey, Mokku!

54
00:07:36,924 --> 00:07:37,807
Shut up!

55
00:07:38,910 --> 00:07:39,920
He's gone...

56
00:07:41,580 --> 00:07:43,840
Whatever. Good riddance
to that annoying pest...

57
00:07:46,875 --> 00:07:48,700
Well, if it isn't Mokku!

58
00:07:51,250 --> 00:07:52,250
Um... boss?

59
00:07:52,940 --> 00:07:53,940
What!

60
00:07:54,530 --> 00:07:57,996
Starting tomorrow, I'm going to work
as hard as I can for you, boss!

61
00:07:58,329 --> 00:08:00,566
Well, that's an admirable attitude.

62
00:08:00,590 --> 00:08:05,960
If you're going to be cooperative, it'll
save me the trouble of yelling at you.

63
00:08:09,420 --> 00:08:10,780
In return, though...

64
00:08:11,380 --> 00:08:12,380
What?

65
00:08:14,515 --> 00:08:17,420
I want you to give me
a share of what I earn.

66
00:08:18,174 --> 00:08:19,174
What?!

67
00:08:20,745 --> 00:08:22,018
Take that back!

68
00:08:24,825 --> 00:08:26,220
You little...

69
00:08:44,384 --> 00:08:45,579
I see!

70
00:08:48,459 --> 00:08:54,029
If you're gonna become more popular
and work hard, I've got no complaints.

71
00:08:54,054 --> 00:08:55,941
Fine, I'll give you a cut.

72
00:08:57,487 --> 00:08:59,341
Thank you, boss!

73
00:08:59,421 --> 00:09:00,366
I'll do my best.

74
00:09:00,413 --> 00:09:04,820
Good, good boy. I'll give you plenty,
so go on to sleep now.

75
00:09:09,434 --> 00:09:11,160
Stupid puppet.

76
00:09:28,769 --> 00:09:30,180
Bring out Mokku!

77
00:09:30,360 --> 00:09:32,280
Yeah! Bring him out!

78
00:09:35,600 --> 00:09:36,600
Ta-da!

79
00:10:03,802 --> 00:10:05,802


80
00:10:18,555 --> 00:10:21,020
I'm making a fortune here!

81
00:10:21,060 --> 00:10:22,177
Um, boss!

82
00:10:24,859 --> 00:10:26,480
Got something to say?

83
00:10:26,754 --> 00:10:28,746
About my promised share...

84
00:10:29,130 --> 00:10:31,965
I'm worried about Grandpa,
so please let me go home.

85
00:10:32,675 --> 00:10:34,223
What?!

86
00:10:34,364 --> 00:10:35,433
You idiot!

87
00:10:36,109 --> 00:10:39,457
You think you can leave
after earning this measly bit?

88
00:10:40,015 --> 00:10:42,145
But you promised...

89
00:10:42,888 --> 00:10:44,015
Shut up!

90
00:10:44,635 --> 00:10:45,885
Ah!

91
00:10:49,860 --> 00:10:50,860
Hey!

92
00:10:51,789 --> 00:10:54,260
I never intended to give you
a single penny from the start!

93
00:10:54,615 --> 00:10:56,860
You'll work until you break into pieces!

94
00:10:57,275 --> 00:10:59,282
Understand, you fool?!

95
00:11:09,159 --> 00:11:14,380
Poor Mokku. In the end, we puppets
are just playthings for humans.

96
00:11:35,339 --> 00:11:37,083
Grandpa...

97
00:11:38,659 --> 00:11:42,872
Mokku, just give up. We're puppets.

98
00:11:43,820 --> 00:11:48,900
Humans work us to the bone, and once we
break, they burn us. That's the end of it.

99
00:11:50,005 --> 00:11:51,606
The Cricket was right.

100
00:11:52,036 --> 00:11:53,360
 I was wrong.

101
00:11:54,609 --> 00:11:55,609
Ah...

102
00:12:13,699 --> 00:12:15,668
I worked for that money.

103
00:12:16,020 --> 00:12:17,020
It's mine.

104
00:12:17,585 --> 00:12:21,229
If I take it home, I can buy Grandpa an
overcoat and anything else he needs.

105
00:12:22,029 --> 00:12:25,420
Like hell I'll let that monster
boss keep it all to himself!

106
00:12:25,835 --> 00:12:26,880
All right.

107
00:12:36,530 --> 00:12:38,156
Mokku, what are you going to do?

108
00:12:39,075 --> 00:12:40,660
I'm going to avenge everyone.

109
00:12:41,605 --> 00:12:45,500
Stop it, Mokku. Don't you know
how terrifying the boss is?

110
00:12:46,250 --> 00:12:48,884
He'll smash you to pieces
and throw you into the stove!

111
00:12:49,289 --> 00:12:50,476
Don't do it, Mokku.

112
00:13:05,582 --> 00:13:07,702
I'll steal the key to get outside...

113
00:13:13,846 --> 00:13:17,222


114
00:14:47,199 --> 00:14:48,317
Look, it worked.

115
00:14:48,341 --> 00:14:50,600
Mokku, run while you have
the chance. Come on, hurry!

116
00:14:50,740 --> 00:14:52,560
Let's all escape together!

117
00:14:53,675 --> 00:14:57,060
We can't. We can't walk on
our own like you, Mokku.

118
00:14:57,405 --> 00:14:59,320
Don't worry about us.
Get out of here, quick!

119
00:14:59,585 --> 00:15:00,585
No!

120
00:15:02,314 --> 00:15:03,314
All right.

121
00:15:04,430 --> 00:15:06,922
There's no way I'm leaving you
in a terrifying place like this!

122
00:15:30,600 --> 00:15:32,820
Huh?! What? Mokku!

123
00:15:34,839 --> 00:15:38,418
That bastard's trying to run
off after stealing my money?!

124
00:15:39,620 --> 00:15:40,620
Wait!!

125
00:15:42,880 --> 00:15:43,880
Wait, wait!

126
00:15:46,099 --> 00:15:47,200
Gotcha, you little bastard!

127
00:15:47,224 --> 00:15:49,616
No! I worked hard for this money!

128
00:15:49,640 --> 00:15:50,929
You worthless brat!

129
00:15:54,559 --> 00:15:55,559
Now!

130
00:16:02,099 --> 00:16:03,902
Like hell I'll let you get away!

131
00:16:22,241 --> 00:16:24,565
Hold it right there!

132
00:16:25,071 --> 00:16:25,961
Wait!

133
00:16:25,985 --> 00:16:29,341
You think you can get away from me?!

134
00:16:41,650 --> 00:16:43,900
Don't worry about us, just run!

135
00:16:43,910 --> 00:16:45,520
Hurry, run away on your own!

136
00:16:47,855 --> 00:16:50,020
Mokku, don't worry about us!

137
00:17:08,809 --> 00:17:11,041
Hold it, damn it!

138
00:17:16,799 --> 00:17:18,400
I'm sorry we ran away!

139
00:17:19,199 --> 00:17:21,440
Hey, get back here!

140
00:17:21,805 --> 00:17:22,805
Ah, he's coming!

141
00:17:25,839 --> 00:17:29,185
Wait! Wait, wait, wait, hold on!

142
00:17:34,029 --> 00:17:36,459
Hold on, you little brat!

143
00:17:49,889 --> 00:17:51,889
Hold on—you little punk!

144
00:17:54,209 --> 00:17:55,412
Got you now!

145
00:17:55,490 --> 00:17:58,529
- No... help me!
- Begging won't save you!

146
00:18:05,467 --> 00:18:07,866
Help me!

147
00:18:27,674 --> 00:18:31,240
Why do I have to suffer like this?

148
00:18:32,894 --> 00:18:34,880
Because I'm a puppet...

149
00:18:35,129 --> 00:18:39,880
I hate this... Being a puppet...
I want to become human.

150
00:18:42,309 --> 00:18:44,542
I want to become human!

151
00:19:11,799 --> 00:19:16,940
Mokku, I am the Fairy of the
Oak Tree, your birthplace.

152
00:19:17,200 --> 00:19:21,188
Oh, then you're the one
who brought me to life!

153
00:19:25,849 --> 00:19:29,766
I don't want to be a puppet anymore.
I want to become human!

154
00:19:30,119 --> 00:19:32,359
I do not possess that power.

155
00:19:32,999 --> 00:19:35,260
What? Then I can never become human?

156
00:19:36,060 --> 00:19:37,060
You can.

157
00:19:39,354 --> 00:19:42,980
Mokku, becoming human
is entirely up to you.

158
00:19:43,589 --> 00:19:46,802
What should I do? Please, tell me!

159
00:19:47,144 --> 00:19:48,982
Always be a good boy.

160
00:19:49,459 --> 00:19:54,600
If you have a righteous and kind heart,
you will surely become human.

161
00:19:55,020 --> 00:19:56,020
Really?

162
00:19:56,479 --> 00:20:03,239
It is true. You must always strive
to have a good and kind heart.

163
00:20:03,449 --> 00:20:09,380
I'll try my best to have a good, kind heart.
And I'll definitely become human.

164
00:20:09,965 --> 00:20:13,940
I'll be looking forward to that day, Mokku.

165
00:20:18,899 --> 00:20:20,994
Goodbye, Mokku.

166
00:20:33,689 --> 00:20:36,480
A good heart, a kind heart...

167
00:20:42,309 --> 00:20:47,340
Mokku, won't you ever come back home to me?

168
00:20:47,894 --> 00:20:51,720
I could never make another you again.

169
00:20:51,783 --> 00:20:53,783
Grandpa!

170
00:20:57,760 --> 00:20:59,660
Was I just hearing things?

171
00:21:00,010 --> 00:21:02,010
Grandpa!

172
00:21:02,893 --> 00:21:03,987


173
00:21:08,918 --> 00:21:10,916
Grandpa!

174
00:21:18,200 --> 00:21:19,727
Mokku!

175
00:21:24,524 --> 00:21:26,523
Mokku!

176
00:21:28,299 --> 00:21:30,291
Grandpa!

177
00:21:31,440 --> 00:21:32,705
Mokku!

178
00:21:35,089 --> 00:21:37,573
Grandpa!

179
00:21:37,995 --> 00:21:40,027
Mokku!

180
00:21:46,460 --> 00:21:47,365
Grandpa!

181
00:21:47,390 --> 00:21:48,460
Mokku!

182
00:21:49,040 --> 00:21:55,080
Grandpa, I'm sorry. I'll be a good boy.
I'll become human. I'll go to school, too.

183
00:21:55,620 --> 00:21:58,180
Mokku... Mokku...

184
00:22:12,849 --> 00:22:14,075
I'm off!

185
00:22:14,252 --> 00:22:15,252
All right.

186
00:22:15,349 --> 00:22:17,000
Grandpa, I'm heading out!

187
00:22:18,299 --> 00:22:19,519
Take care.

188
00:22:22,939 --> 00:22:24,720
Go straight to school, now.

189
00:22:44,824 --> 00:22:47,392
You're called Mokku, aren't you?

190
00:22:49,028 --> 00:22:51,399
I know a really fun place.

191
00:22:51,424 --> 00:22:52,540
Really?

192
00:22:52,541 --> 00:22:54,460
Come on, let's go together!

193
00:22:56,580 --> 00:22:59,440
Mokku, it's such a wonderful place.

194
00:22:59,554 --> 00:23:00,554
Hmph! No way!

195
00:23:23,436 --> 00:23:27,225
Hey! Wait for me!

196
00:23:33,679 --> 00:23:36,340
<i>Mokku and Grandfather
live very happily together.</i>

197
00:23:37,099 --> 00:23:37,649
<i>However...</i>

198
00:23:37,673 --> 00:23:40,110
<i>...because Grandfather
dotes on Mokku so much...</i>

199
00:23:40,134 --> 00:23:44,320
<i>...Redbeard the mouse, who lived
there first, grows jealous.</i>

200
00:23:45,057 --> 00:23:45,815
<i>And then...</i>

201
00:23:45,839 --> 00:23:48,305
<i>...scheming with Kenken
the fox and his gang...</i>

202
00:23:48,329 --> 00:23:50,420
<i>...Redbeard pushes Mokku into the river.</i>

203
00:23:51,560 --> 00:23:56,640
<i>After swallowing so much freezing river
water, will Mokku be able to revive?</i>

204
00:23:57,429 --> 00:24:00,207
<i>Look forward to next week's
Kashi no Ki Mokku!</i>

